  "title": "Lumexa Imaging Announces Preliminary Unaudited Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Results; Provides 2026 Financial Guidance and Earnings Conference Call Date",
  "summary": "RALEIGH, NORTH CAROLINA, March 2, 2026—Lumexa Imaging Holdings, Inc. (“Lumexa Imaging” or “we”), one of the nation’s largest providers of outpatient imaging services, today announced certain preliminary unaudited financial results for the fourth quarter and full year ended December 31, 2025. The financial results included in this release pertaining to the fourth quarter and full year 2025 are preliminary, unaudited, and subject to final review and adjustment.",
